      "id": "file:act/runtime/control_loop.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "control_loop.py",
      "filePath": "act/runtime/control_loop.py",
      "summary": "ACT 推理栈的核心控制环：在每个 tick 内协调观测采集、推理提交、chunk 接受/丢弃、动作选择、安全降级（fallback）、状态机更新与指令发布，是整个运行时的中枢调度器。",
      "tags": [
        "runtime",
        "control-loop",
        "state-machine",
        "safety",
        "entry-point"
      ],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "包含枚举化的 FallbackReason、候选/回退选择函数，以及一个 600+ 行的 ControlLoop 类，管理 active/pending chunk 与 output/runtime fault latch。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:act/runtime/inference_channel.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "inference_channel.py",
      "filePath": "act/runtime/inference_channel.py",
      "summary": "定义推理请求/结果的数据载体 InferenceRequest/InferenceResult，以及去重保最新的 LatestQueue 队列，作为控制环与推理 worker 之间的线程安全通信通道。",
      "tags": [
        "runtime",
        "data-model",
        "queue",
        "concurrency"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "LatestQueue 以 monotonic 序号实现“丢弃旧值、保留最新”语义，并在 get 时跳过已消费的重复项。"
    },
